<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's CMVM suspends Lisnave.</title>
<headline>Portugal's CMVM suspends Lisnave.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Financial Markets Committee formally suspended ship repairer Lisnave on Wednesday after the bourse ordered a halt to trade in the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>The decision by the country's financial watchdog reinforced the bourse's demand for more information about the company's restructuring before allowing trade to resume, they said.</p>
<p>The company admitted in a statement earlier on Wednesday that the restructuring would involve a capital writedown but it gave no details.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
